      "required_behavior_delta": "Docker containers built from the repository must have the `patch` executable available in `$PATH`, allowing the harness script to apply patches successfully.",
      "implementation_steps": [
        "1. Insert a `RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y patch && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*` line after the `pip install` step in the Dockerfile.",
